<title>UK: EIB to launch 500 mln stg Eurobond due June 2002.</title>
<headline>EIB to launch 500 mln stg Eurobond due June 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank intends to launch a 500 million stg Eurobond with a June 7, 2002 maturity in the near future, BZW and Salomon Brothers International said as joint lead managers.  </p>
<p>Pricing will be determined nearer the time of launch, the leads said.</p>
<p>The maturity will match an outstanding 7.00 percent gilt.  </p>
<p>A Eurobond syndicate head at a British bank said the deal could come at any time. &quot;The deal would target institutions looking for a bit of pick-up over gilts,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Spread talk was up to five basis points over gilts, with some traders expecting between two and three b.p. over.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
